    "group": "Crusher Stampede",
    "summary": "When a TYRANIDS MONSTER model in your army attacks, its [Hit roll](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls) gets +1 while its unit is under [Starting Strength](vsdata:core-rule/units-and-models), and its [Wound roll](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls) also gets +1 once the unit has fallen Below Half-strength. Your TYRANIDS MONSTER units that are at full Starting Strength and not [Battle-shocked](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock) also give their models +2 [Objective Control](vsdata:core-rule/level-of-control).",
